Good day! We have received a request from your account for a subscription quot;Skype unlimited Earth phone plan&quot; at App Store on a computer or another device that has not previously been associated with that Apple ID. This sign up was fixed by our new automated protection service as a highly risky. In this respect, we have set suspension for 72 hours for the activation request of the purchase. After this term, the required amount will be taken from your Apple ID and the atonement will be put on. If you've made this subscription, please accept our apologies for the annoyance and just ignore this email. If this action was made by the third person, and you want to unsubscribe, click on the link under the subscription options in this message, and then change the password on your account, possibly it was stolen. Subscription information: Subscription name: Skype unlimited world calls plan Application name: Skype Company: Microsoft inc. The period of subscription: 5 days Price for the period: 23.99 EUR Subscriber's IP address: 176.212.63.114 (Volgograd, Russia) Unsubscribe and Manage Subscriptions We recall that your financial reporting data is stored in safety on our servers and nobody can reach it. We will never ask you to give us your profile details, financial information and other personal information by e-mail or phone. Thanks a lot for using our service. Kind regards The App Store team. Apple Inc. The terms of buying sign up you can find here: Terms and Conditions Answers to FAQs can be found here: FAQ We respect your private life, the information of your data usage can be found here: Privacy Policy Copyright 2014 Apple Inc. Please do not reply to this email because we are not monitoring this inbox. To get in contact with us, log in to your Apple ID and click quot;Contact Squat; at the bottom of any page. Copyright 2015 Apple Inc. All rights reserved. Email ID:bfab1280dbda.",i04,Content Access,"GENERAL SETTINGS
