al expenses.After our free movement by the Nigerian Government. Please reply urgently and treat with absolute confidentiality and sincerity through the above E-mail address. You should note that even if you are not interested you should not let out this proposal to anybody whatever. You should urgently get across to my Attorney so that he can give you the necessary advice on the procedure and requirements for this transaction.  Best Regards, HAJ IA MARIAM APACHE (MRS.)  ",i04,Content Access,"GENERAL SETTINGS
