nces must be channeled to our legal adviser Leonard Obi Esq through his direct Tel. No:234-1-4705964. I must also use this opportunity to implore you to exercise the utmost indulgence to keep this transaction a confidential issue. You can also contact me directly on my secret telephone:-234-1-4705964if there is need. Thanks and God bless you.DR. (MRS.) MARYAM APACHE. ---------------------------------Do you Yahoo!? Yahoo! Mail Plus - Powerful. Affordable. Sign up now",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
