28386,"Unverified payment with your account.
Good afternoon! We have received a request from your Apple ID for a subscription ""Skype unlimited {Earth|world|full planet|planet phone service"" at iTunes store on a computer or gadget that has not earlier been connected with this Apple ID. This action was identified by our newest automated anti-fraud service as a risky. In that regard, we have set suspension for 3 days for the withdrawal request of the purchase. After this term, the required amount sum will be debited from your default payment option and the subscription will be brought into action. If you've purchased this signup, please accept our apologies for this inconvenience and just delete this message. If this purchasing was made by the third person, and you want to cancel the subscription, click on the link under the subscription options in this email, and then change the password on your account, maybe it was stolen. Sign up information: Subscription name: Skype unlimited planet phone service App name: Skype Company: Microsoft inc. The time of sign up: 5 days Price for the period: 23.89 EUR Subscriber's IP address: 176.212.62.112 (Oral, Russia) Unsubscribe and Manage Subscriptions We remind that your financial data is stored in security on our servers and no one can reach it. We will never ask you to provide us your account details, financial information and other personal data by e-mail or phone. Thank you for using our service. Kind regards, The Apple team. Apple Inc. The terms of buying subscriptions you can find here: Terms and Conditions Answers to FAQs can be found at the following link: FAQ We hold in estimation your private life, the information of your data usage can be found on the following link: Privacy Policy Copyright 2014 Apple Inc. Please do not reply to this email because we are not monitoring this inbox. To get in touch with us, log in to your account and click ""Contact Us"" at the bottom of any page. Copyright 2015 Apple Inc. All rights reserved. Email ID ccbdccde567929bcafcb.",i09,