CONFIDENTIAL PROPOSAL [CODE NO: AM-0007]Good Day, I am Mr. Ming Yang, Director of Operations of the Hang Seng Bank Ltd, Taiwan Ho Branch, Hong Kong. My purpose of contacting you is because you conclave in Hong Kong. I have an obscured business suggestion for you. I am here-by seeking your service in helping me receive a large amount of money and in giving clear research and feasibility studies on areas I could invest on. Your services will be paid for, and you will be a partner, if your recommendation is accepted. As a bank employee, I can not operate any personal investment till I am retired and with the Anti-corruption Bill passed in Hong Kong; it is risky for a fixed income earner to own any huge amount of money in Hong Kong Oran foreign country. It is then advisable to invest in any foreign land secretly and patiently wait retirement. For security purpose, due to telecom interception in Hong Kong, I shallot accept or acknowledge any phone call. Only fax messages/emails would be treated in relation to this proposal but not without this code; [CODE NO: AM-0007]. Should you be further interested, I would prefer you to reach me soon and finally after that I shall provide you with more details of this operation. Kind Regards Mr. Ming Nanchang Sent Bank Tsai Wan Ho Branch171 Saurian Road Hong Kong. Private email: hangsengbank200@yahoo.com.hk",i10,Service and Subscription Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
